canlin HTTP transport spec §5 (canlin#41) loads the CA bundle from that default path; missing bundle = every TLS request fails with tls-trust. getaddrinfo also needs /etc/hosts + resolv.conf.

canlin k75: the canlin runtime (APK and images) ships its own CA bundle; use the same source/version here so every target trusts the same roots. Android 4.4's system store lacks ISRG Root X1.
